Component:
A common saying "Everything in react is a component"
There are 2 types of component in react
1-Functional component           2-Class based component

History:
Functional component is a new way of writing code.Class based component has allways being existed since a long time in  react.U can also say that Class based component is a old way to write code

Functional component is a function that returns some piece of jsx or a react element or composition of react element.
U can also use below approach like
